OL,3,AIran war has led to US munitions
OL,4,Ashortfalls, Pentagon inspector confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US defence department's inspector
OL,7,Fgeneral says the war with Iran has led
OL,8,Fto "shortfalls" in munitions and a
OL,9,Fbottleneck in resupply, contradicting
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump who has repeatly
OL,11,Fdenied the US is facing shortages.
OL,13,FTrump has claimed US munitions supplies
OL,14,Fare "virtually unlimited" and said
OL,15,Freporting otherwise is "fake news".
OL,17,FBut the independent watchdog said the
OL,18,FUS spent more than $22 billion on
OL,19,Fmunitions from February through June,
OL,20,Fleading to "strategic inventory
OL,21,Fshortfalls".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
